        "subject": "LU-18400 tests: enable spl_panic_halt",
        "message": "LU-18400 tests: enable spl_panic_halt\n\nSet spl_panic_halt when loading osd-zfs and when creating or\nimporting zpools, so SPL assertion failures panic the node and\nleave a crash dump instead of hanging the offending thread. Old\nSPL versions without the parameter are silently skipped.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I7b6c33c57050b92e26f1c6436a8a1a6adf2ec3a4\n"
